<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeIsNegated</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to determine if a node has been negated</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">bool SilikoNodeIsNegated(
    const SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeIsNegated</function> determines If
<varname>object</varname> has been negated. A leaf node is negated if
its value is negative. A branch node is negated if its
‘negated’ flag is set by a previous call to
<function>SilikoNodeNegate</function>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodeIsNegated</function> returns
<literal>true</literal> if <varname>object</varname> is a leaf node
with a value less than 0 or 0.0 or if <varname>object</varname> is a
branch node and its ‘negated’ flag is set.
<function>SilikoNodeIsNegated</function> returns
<literal>false</literal> in all other conditions.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
